                      (            os9.d):00044         *
                      (            os9.d):00045         *          1984/05/05  Mark G. Hawkins
                      (            os9.d):00046         * Added label SS.SetMF to Gimix Reserved byte
                      (            os9.d):00047         * Changed SS.Sound to SS.KySns.
                      (            os9.d):00048         *
                      (            os9.d):00049         *          1985/05/24  Mark G. Hawkins
